From: kino <<EMAIL>>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 11:03:41 -1000
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] input: touchscreen: add NT36XXX I2C driver for BL6000
 Pro (NT36675 TDDI)

Novatek reference I2C driver (from LineageOS sdm660 lineage-20), with the
msm-only drm_panel hooks disabled (fb notifier path used), boot-time FW
update and MP test disabled, height 2300. Matches the stock DT node
novatek,NVT-ts @0x62, reset gpio 20, irq gpio 21.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
